# =============================================================================
# AURA Core — Native Intelligence Platform (Foundation Packages)
# These packages are required for the AURA Core service and are included
# in ALL editions (Home, Developer, Lite). AURA Core runs without AI models
# and without internet, providing security monitoring and service management.
# Target: Debian 13 (Trixie) amd64
# =============================================================================

# --- Python 3 runtime (for the AURA service) ---
python3
python3-dbus
python3-gi
python3-yaml
python3-pip
python3-setuptools
python3-psutil

# --- Optional local inference backend ---
# llama.cpp may or may not be packaged in Debian Trixie at time of build;
# the AURA intelligence engine gracefully stays UNAVAILABLE when the binary
# is not installed, and users can install it post-install. Administrators
# may uncomment or add the actual package name here if their mirror has it.
# llama.cpp

# --- D-Bus and systemd (required for service activation) ---
dbus
systemd
policykit-1
policykit-1-gnome
gir1.2-polkit-1.0

# --- Security monitoring prerequisites ---
# Used by Phase 4 security engine
auditd
apparmor
apparmor-utils
iptables
nftables
inotify-tools
